      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_01.mp3",
      "text": "Be careful child\u2026",
      "duration": 1.892
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Graves",
      "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_02.mp3",
      "text": "What, or I'll end up like you?",
      "duration": 1.7
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_03.mp3",
      "text": "Please, stay on the path you're on and you won't live long enough to end up like me.",
      "duration": 5.93
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Graves",
      "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_04.mp3",
      "text": "Don't pretend like you care if I live or die.",
      "duration": 2.294
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_necro_gigawatt_convo01_05.mp3",
      "text": "I'm not invested in your surivial, I just hate to see talent wasted.",
      "duration": 4.423
    }
  ]
